<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>This is―
{PAUSE ""}
the Jusatsu Arc, the first arc you watched.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
It seems great changes are occurring in each of its endings.<PG>
Now, let us see for ourselves what kind of changes take place.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "立木三日" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
